  "studies": [{"study_index": 24, "title": "Diagnostic accuracy of Risk of Ovarian Malignancy Algorithm (ROMA) in       
  post-menopausal patients with ovarian mass", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE To determine the diagnostic accuracy of ROMA in   
  postmenopausal women with history of ovarian mass. STUDY DESIGN Observational study. PLACE AND DURATION OF STUDY Dr.  
  Ziauddin University Hospital, Karachi, from May 2014 to June 2015. METHODOLOGY Two hundred and sixty postmenopausal   
