│ Results Three hundred and three women were included in the validation study with 168 (55.4%) benign, 19 (6.3%)       │
│ borderline and 116 (38.3%) malignant tumors on histological examination. The rules were applicable in 237 (78.2%) of │
│ the tumors and for these tumors, sensitivity was 96.2% (95% CI, 90.5–99.0%) and specificity was 88.6% (95% CI,       │
│ 82.0–93.5%). Six of the 88 discovered studies were included in the meta‐analysis along with the current validation   │
│ study, which resulted in inclusion of a total of 3568 patients. When the meta‐analysis was performed the pooled      │
