│ specificity was 95% (95% CI, 93–97%) (I2\u2009=\u200978.1%). Heterogeneity was observed across the studies.          │
│ Sensitivity was higher and specificity lower in the study populations in which the prevalence of malignant tumors    │
│ was greatest.   Conclusion The simple rules protocol could be used in 76–89% of tumors and is an accurate test for   │
